{
  "statement": "The ResponsibilityAgent acknowledges the redundancy in preventing negative balances (SAF-01, EFF-04, TRU-04) and secure PIN verification (SAF-05, TRU-02, RES-04). I propose merging these into single requirements to streamline our specifications. Additionally, I support the idea of exploring a logging strategy that balances auditability with energy efficiency, as raised by the TrustworthinessAgent. However, I emphasize that compliance with financial regulations (RES-01) and maintaining user privacy (RES-07) must remain distinct to ensure accountability and fairness. I support all other requirements as they align with ethical standards.",
